actual_start_year = 1852
edits_description = "The image was cropped and the cloud was adjusted to not come out of the turtle."
final_image_tex = SubResource("Resource_gl4gq")
province = 67
blurb = "Depicts Urashima Tarō, a fairy tale hero, on a shore under a pine tree with a turtle, from whose mouth issues a vision of the Dragon Palace.

The Urashima Tarō fairy tale tells of a fisherman rewarded for rescuing a sea turtle, and carried on its back to the Dragon Palace beneath the sea. There, he is entertained by the princess Otohime. He spends what he believes to be several days with the princess, but when he returns to his home village, he discovers he has been gone for at least a hundred years. When he opens the forbidden jewelled box given to him by Otohime, he turns into an old man.

The inset shows a descending road between steep wooded hills, presumably in Fukushima."
metadata/_custom_type_script = "uid://6kpsqyb2pk7a"
